.TH OPEN-MEDIA-CONVERTER 1 "September 2026" "Open Media Converter" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
open-media-converter \- convert media and documents with a native GTK interface
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B open-media-converter
.RI [ options ]
.RI [ files ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Open Media Converter converts video, audio, images and documents. Add files,
configure section settings or per-file presets, and start a conversion batch.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --help, -h
Show command-line usage.
.TP
.B --version, -v
Show the application version.
.TP
.B --debug
Enable diagnostic logging.
.TP
.BI --config-dir " directory"
Use an alternative configuration directory.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B JAVA_HOME
Select a Java 23 or newer installation.
.TP
.B OMC_DEBUG
Set to 1 to enable diagnostic logging.
.TP
.B GTK_THEME
Override the GTK theme.
.SH FILES
.I ~/.config/open-media-converter/
stores settings, presets and session state.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ffmpeg (1),
.BR pandoc (1),
.BR convert (1),
.BR libreoffice (1)
